SUMMARY:BASS2025 Wrap Up & Favorite Stories
DESCRIPTION:Novel Lovers of Sonoma County\, CA\nWe've been discussing *The
  Best American Short Stories 2025*\, one story every other week. Today is 
 a wrap-up\, discussing the anthology as a whole and our favorite stories. 
 **To prepare\, please send a list of your 3 favorites to [joan@joanprice.c
 om](joan@joanprice.com) by Oct. 5.** Joan will tally them and announce the
  group favorites here and on our Discord so you can review them before our
  meeting.
